      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your feelings are valid, and this sense of internal emptiness is a deep, existential pain. It's understandable that when your identity felt so closely tied to your physical abilities, their loss feels like a complete erasure of self. Perhaps the focus needs to shift from what your body *can't* do to what you *can* still feel, even if it's just a flicker of something. Exploring new ways to connect with yourself, outside of performance, might offer a different kind of foundation.",
